  Slug: caveclimber-kobold
  DisplayName: Caveclimber Kobold
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: You live in a vertically-oriented home, and you're a consummate climber.
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Combat Climber] skill feat,
    even if you don't meet the prerequisites. You can use your clawed feet and tail
    to Climb, leaving your hands free. Additionally, if you succeed at an Athletics
    check to Climb, you critically succeed instead.
